@startuml deployment
' UML deployment diagram – môi trường local, CI và production (Task 3.2)
' Nền tảng thực tế: Vercel (web), Render (API, BrewPay), Neon (PostgreSQL), GitHub Actions + GHCR (CI/CD)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8EE
  BorderColor #5A3A22
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #5A3A22
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #5A3A22
}
left to right direction

rectangle "CI/CD – GitHub" as CI #F5F5F5 {
  artifact "GitHub Secrets\n----\nDATABASE_URL\nRENDER_DEPLOY_HOOK_API,\nRENDER_DEPLOY_HOOK_PAY\nVERCEL_TOKEN, VERCEL_ORG_ID,\nVERCEL_PROJECT_ID" as Secrets
  node "GitHub Actions runner\n<<ubuntu-latest>>" as Runner {
    artifact "ci.yml (pull request)\nlint → test → build" as CiYml
    artifact "cd.yml (push main / tag)\nquality gate → image → push\n→ migrate → deploy → smoke test" as CdYml
    database "postgres:16\nservice container\n(integration test)" as CiPg
  }
  node "GitHub Container Registry\nghcr.io" as GHCR {
    artifact "brewlite-api\nbrewlite-pay\ntag <commit-sha>, vX.Y.Z" as Img
  }
}

rectangle "PRODUCTION" as PROD #FAFAFA {
  node "Thiết bị người dùng\n<<device>>" as Device {
    artifact "Trình duyệt / PWA\nmanifest + service worker" as Browser
  }
  node "Vercel Edge Network (CDN)\n<<PaaS, Hobby>>\n----\nenv: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL\nlog: Vercel Runtime Logs" as Vercel {
    artifact "apps/web\nNext.js build" as WebBuild
  }
  node "Render Web Service – API\n<<Docker container, Free, Singapore>>\n----\nenv: DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET,\nJWT_EXPIRES_IN, FRONTEND_URL,\nGATEWAY_SECRET, GATEWAY_PUBLIC_URL\nhealth check: GET /health\nlog: Render Logs (stdout)" as Render {
    artifact "brewlite-api:<commit-sha>\nNestJS, cổng $PORT" as ApiImage
  }
  node "Render Web Service – BrewPay\n<<Docker container, Free, Singapore>>\n----\nenv: GATEWAY_SECRET,\nBACKEND_WEBHOOK_URL\nhealth check: GET /health\n(hệ thống bên thứ ba mô phỏng)" as RenderPay {
    artifact "brewlite-pay:<commit-sha>\nNode.js, cổng $PORT" as PayImage
  }
  node "Neon Serverless Postgres\n<<DBaaS, Free, ap-southeast-1>>\n----\nchỉ API và job migrate\ngiữ chuỗi kết nối" as Neon {
    database "PostgreSQL 16\nlưu trữ bền vững" as PG
  }
}

rectangle "LOCAL – máy dev" as LOCAL #F5F5F5 {
  node "Docker Compose" as Dev {
    artifact "web :3000" as LWeb
    artifact "api :4000" as LApi
    artifact "gateway :5000\n(BrewPay)" as LPay
    database "db :5432\nvolume db_data" as LDb
  }
}

Secrets ..> CdYml : biến môi trường
CiYml --> CiPg : test
CdYml --> Img : docker push
CdYml --> Neon : prisma migrate deploy\n(TLS)
CdYml --> Render : deploy hook HTTPS\n?imgURL=…:<sha>
CdYml --> RenderPay : deploy hook HTTPS\n?imgURL=…:<sha>
CdYml --> Vercel : vercel deploy --prod
CdYml ..> Render : smoke test\nGET /health
Render ..> GHCR : kéo image\n(read:packages)
RenderPay ..> GHCR : kéo image

Browser --> WebBuild : HTTPS 443
Browser --> ApiImage : HTTPS 443\nREST JSON + JWT\nCORS: chỉ origin web
Browser --> PayImage : HTTPS 443\nmở paymentUrl (quét QR)
PayImage --> ApiImage : HTTPS 443\nPOST /payments/webhook\nX-BrewPay-Signature
ApiImage --> PG : TCP 5432, TLS\nsslmode=require

LWeb --> LApi : HTTP
LPay --> LApi : webhook HTTP
LApi --> LDb : TCP
@enduml
